{"object":"Occupation","stdCode":"OCC0232","name":"Senior production chef","status":1,"statusName":"Approved occupation","level":3,"versionNo":"1.4","statusLastUpdated":"2016-09-07","summary":"<p>Senior production chefs may lead a brigade team or may support the head chef in larger establishments. They report activities to the Head chef or appropriate line manager. They supervise production chef teams in a variety of kitchen environments, for example; schools, hospitals, the Armed Forces, care homes and high street casual dining or pub kitchens. Job roles include Head chef, Second Chef, Kitchen Manager / Supervisor, Cook. Senior production chefs have accountability for the day-to-day running of the kitchen service, producing, monitoring and maintaining consistent food standards, legislative requirements and quality across all areas and during all stages of production and supply.</p>","overview":"Managing a team to produce standardised dishes and menus within a kitchen environment.","involvedEmployers":"Ask Italian, Association of Licensed Multiple Retailers (ALMR), Bartlett Mitchell, Brend Hotels, British Army. Caffe Nero Group Ltd, Center Parcs, Greene King PLC, Hilton, J D Wetherspoon, LACA, Marston's PLC, Mitchells & Butlers, Nandos, Omni Facilities Management, PGL, Pizza Hut, Royal Air Force, Royal Navy, Sea Fish","keywords":["cooking","dining","eating","food","Hospitality","kitchen","pubs","restaurants"],"typicalJobTitles":[{"name":"chef","isGreen":false},{"name":"cook","isGreen":false},{"name":"head chef","isGreen":false}],"soc":{"soc2010Code":5434,"soc2010Description":"Chefs","soc2020Code":5435,"soc2020Description":"Cooks","soc2020SubUnitGroups":[{"code":"5435/00","description":"Cooks","isPrimary":true},{"code":"5434/00","description":"Chefs   ","isPrimary":false}]},"mapHierarchy":{"routeId":3,"routeName":"Catering and hospitality","routeSequence":3,"pathwayId":14,"pathwayName":"Catering","clusterGroupId":9,"clusterId":18,"clusterName":"Caterer","technicalLev